 {"id": "PEDS-C35-105", "sec": "Hereditary nephritis", "page": 161, "q": "The classic triad of Alport syndrome is —", "opts": ["Cyanosis, clubbing and polycythemia of CHD", "Hematuria, high-frequency sensorineural hearing loss, ocular findings", "Proteinuria, anasarca and hyperlipidemia of nephrosis", "Fever, rash and migrating polyarthritis of ARF"], "ans": 1, "exp": "Triad: hematuria, high-frequency sensorineural hearing loss, ocular findings (Book p161)", "type": "mcq"},
